cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use skill-image-tuner in research, tools, design systems, or agent architectures, cite it as follows."
title: "image-tuner: universal interactive image positioning, scaling, and framing tuner HUD"
abstract: >-
  skill-image-tuner provides an interactive visual staging canvas and HUD to
  eliminate trial-and-error CSS image positioning, scaling, anchoring, and
  framing. Supports pan, pinch-to-zoom, knob/gesture rotation, horizontal
  mirroring, visual transform-origin picking, composition grids, and live
  multi-format code export (CSS, React, Tailwind, JSON). Ships as a universal
  agent skill (SKILL.md) and standalone tool compatible with Claude Code, pi,
  Codex, Cursor, Gemini CLI, and Windsurf.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/gaia-research/skill-image-tuner"
url: "https://github.com/gaia-research/skill-image-tuner#readme"
